BKU WB CPO

Allows Wholesale Banking CPO users to view and edit Loan Inquiry records, and view Opportunity records.

BKU WB RM

Allows Wholesale Banking RM users to view Loan Inquiry records, and edit the Loan Inquiry field on Opportunity.

BKU Wholesale Banking (group)

Allows Wholesale Banking users access to Loan Inquiry and Opportunity through the BKU WB CPO and BKU WB RM permission sets.

